# =============================================================================
# CENÁRIO 2 — JWT com assinatura inválida → 401
# =============================================================================

### C2 — Assinatura inválida → esperado: 401
GET {{gateway}}/api/sentinel-service/anomalies
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJmYWtlIn0.assinatura_invalida

# =============================================================================
# CENÁRIO 3 — Requisição sem token → 401
# =============================================================================

### C3 — Sem token → esperado: 401
GET {{gateway}}/api/sentinel-service/anomalies

# =============================================================================
# CENÁRIO 4 — Usuário com role user acessa /anomalies/report → 403
# =============================================================================

### C4 — testuser (role: user) → /anomalies/report → esperado: 403
GET {{gateway}}/api/sentinel-service/anomalies/report
Authorization: Bearer {{testuserToken}}

# =============================================================================
# CENÁRIO 5 — Token de usuário acessa /audit-logs diretamente → 401
# Token gateway-client não tem aud:audit-service — rejeitado por audience
# =============================================================================

### C5 — testuserToken → /audit-logs → esperado: 401 (audience inválida)
GET {{gateway}}/api/audit-service/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{testuserToken}}

# =============================================================================
# CENÁRIO 6 — Token M2M (role: service) acessa /audit-logs → 200
# =============================================================================

### C6 — serviceToken → /audit-logs → esperado: 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/audit-service/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}

# =============================================================================
# CENÁRIO 9 — Brute force → conta bloqueada após 5 tentativas
# PRÉ-REQUISITO: Direct access grants ON temporariamente no gateway-client
# Após o teste: desabilitar e re-exportar o realm
# =============================================================================

### C9.1 — Tentativa 1 (senha errada) → esperado: 401 Invalid credentials
POST {{realm}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}&username=testuser&password=senha_errada

